            "path": "content/audio/.cache/doubao/sections/081/02/fragments/19fecad3880bc49ed9223087a7580d6fe891869c99fc02f952fbf61f318e459a.wav",
            "fileHash": "63eed19cba3857a390f8375201ce89ef78315862357cfae8000b3dc717b4e805",
            "subtitleText": "正是，正是！只消这一句。你若说得出口，我们掉头就走。"
          },
          {
            "targetId": "dialogue:081-b0257:u02",
            "path": "content/audio/.cache/doubao/sections/081/02/fragments/c03d8ad6cb151411dae40166b0b52b3acdfc025b5a66f4db1b70eaf3841fa47d.wav",
            "fileHash": "66e51cf80a822ceca0e706117388d46a71b6a07da684325ec4a4231ad5d89f18",
            "subtitleText": "那时放你们入园的人，岂不也受连累？"
          },
          {
            "targetId": "dialogue:081-b0059:u02",
            "path": "content/audio/.cache/doubao/sections/081/02/fragments/c80c5b7a0607bf9f7ea25052dfe6c486170638470c8a1d6807e6863b2a61da5f.wav",
            "fileHash": "d402209f91fbdc0b4a073b5a0aeb0e4e79f7b7016b97a8bf3ae9ce6e1a677b2e",
            "subtitleText": "此刻悄悄出去要紧，若叫有心人撞见，再走便迟了。"
          },
          {
            "targetId": "dialogue:081-b0061:u02",
            "path": "content/audio/.cache/doubao/sections/081/02/fragments/de9cf1262b46dbced79156f46b19408278a913d8d4782fcb89806feb5d7c88d2.wav",
            "fileHash": "b6e4b5209bb5ef7d84b012b2e186ecba0a257b21e52ede634b99b70ce99e4d0e",
            "subtitleText": "只劝一句，这样两面三刀的耳报神，再不可留在身边。"
          }
        ],
